OL,3,GNEWSAShops closed after selling illegal
OL,4,Atobacco and vapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour shops in Nottinghamshire have been
OL,7,Fforced to close after they were found
OL,8,Fselling illegal cigarettes and vapes.
OL,10,FThe county council said #110,845 worth
OL,11,Fof tobacco products were seized by its
OL,12,Ftrading standards team and
OL,13,FNottinghamshire Police during a series
OL,14,Fof raids.
OL,16,FThe council's cabinet member for
OL,17,Fcommunities and public health, Jody
OL,18,FStoll, said the authority "will not
OL,19,Ftolerate this level of criminality."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
