OL,3,GNEWSAShops closed after selling illegal
OL,4,Atobacco and vapes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Illegal tobacco products pose a
OL,7,Fserious threat to public health and
OL,8,Fdamage the local economy. Those who
OL,9,Fsell them undercut law-abiding traders
OL,10,Fand evade taxes that fund vital public
OL,11,Fservices," he said.
